; Canonical Datom examples for meta-signal-router.
; Every line is one contract head: a Query or a Response.

Extend.{ channel-aab Permanent }
Deny.{ adjudication-7 «the owner declined this channel» }
SetMirrorEnabled.True
Revoke.{ channel-aab «the grant expired» }
Grant.{ External.Network.{ hexis 7421 } Internal.Harness [ MessageDelivery TranscriptEvent ] TimeBound.1757600000000000000 }
